# {{NAME}}

This project is a Wayfarer Wanderer starter generated offline: a plain IntelliJ module that uses a local JDK {{JDK_VERSION}}.

It has no build tool and downloads nothing. `src/App.java` is a compact source file (JEP 512): a `main` method with no
package or class around it. Wayfarer Wanderer compiles `src` with `javac` into `out/production/{{MODULE}}` and runs
`App`; IntelliJ IDEA opens the same folder as its own project. If a build fails, correct the source and retry; files
already generated remain available. Wayfarer Wanderer does not initialize Git for a generated project.
